BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Kingman Route 66 Fest
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261016
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261018
DTSTAMP:20261021T160817Z
UID:ef7a78edb33dc4b16f9cea7c@visitarizona-calendar
DESCRIPTION:I ♥ 66 Fest is a key celebration of the upcoming Route 66 Ce
 ntennial. It is hosted in beautiful Lewis Kingman Park\, an Arizona oasis 
 along the Mother Road\, and highlights the history and culture surrounding
  America’s Main Street. This Route 66 event offers a long list of things
  to do on Route 66. The Festival features live bands\, a beer garden servi
 ng regional craft beers\, food and craft vendors\, classic car show\, a vi
 ntage trailer show\, pin-up contest\, Route 66 displays\, fun activity zon
 es\, Kingman's FIRST and ONLY zipline\, a fun photo booth\, children's act
 ivities – it goes on and on! The 66 Fest is free for spectators and free
  public parking is in the adjacent lot at the corner of Andy Devine Ave (R
 oute 66) and Fairgrounds Ave.\n\nEvent website: https://www.66fest.com/\n\
 nVisit Arizona listing: https://www.visitarizona.com/events/kingman-route-
 66-fest
LAST-MODIFIED:20261021T160817Z
LOCATION:Lewis Kingman Park\, East Andy Devine Avenue\, Kingman\, AZ\, USA
URL:https://www.visitarizona.com/events/kingman-route-66-fest
END:VEVENT
