DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261018
DTSTAMP:20261021T160817Z
UID:1b30213a97f3e3612106a7aa@visitarizona-calendar
DESCRIPTION:A breathtakingly challenging course. This race is a "point-to-
 point" course showcasing Sedona’s Southside. It traverses the Broken Arr
 ow trail system on stunning singletrack nestled between red rock spires an
 d ultimately finishes on the iconic Hi-Line trail\; promising the best vie
 w of Cathedral Rock - one of Sedona’s four main energy vortexes. Come ea
 rly for a weekend filled with activities for the family. There is a commun
 ity run on Thursday\, and opening ceremony on Friday\, including a moment 
 of intention and sound healing to cleanse mind and body. #bethebuddha\n\nE
 vent website: http://www.trailrunningescapes.com/rrs.html\n\nVisit Arizona
  listing: https://www.visitarizona.com/events/red-rocks-of-sedona---mounta
 in-marathon-20-mile-and-10-mile
LAST-MODIFIED:20261021T160817Z
URL:https://www.visitarizona.com/events/red-rocks-of-sedona---mountain-mar
 athon-20-mile-and-10-mile
END:VEVENT
